                                                "sense_id": "bdec8625-3f62-3df5-b589-2f20ede54ea9",
                                                "text": "There's a time and a place for mindless activities (we don't need to make them a big deal) but, if done excessively, they don't exactly deliver what they promise. In other words, Xboxing for hours at a time may give you an illusion of rejuvenation but it doesn't truly make you feel rested."
